Date: Mon, 31 Aug 2026 15:03:25 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] fix(app): keep active thread visible in My progress

Promote the routed thread from the canonical sidebar cache when the progress facet omits it, preserving facet order and degraded states.
---
 .../sidebar/MyProgressSidebarSection.test.tsx | 83 ++++++++++++++++++-
 .../sidebar/MyProgressSidebarSection.tsx      | 81 +++++++++++++++---
 2 files changed, 151 insertions(+), 13 deletions(-)

